<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - PolyGram results by sector.</title>
<headline>TABLE - PolyGram results by sector.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Music and entertainment group PolyGram's first half to June 30, 1997, results per sector (millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>MUSIC</p>
<p>    - Net sales (billion)	    3.94 vs   3.63</p>
<p>    - Operating profit	     522    vs 457</p>
<p>FILM</p>
<p>    - Net sales			589    vs 681</p>
<p>    - Operating loss		  92    vs  37</p>
<p>Second quarter to June 30, 1997, results per sector (millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>MUSIC</p>
<p>    - Net sales (billion)	    2.03 vs   1.88</p>
<p>    - Operating profit	     271    vs 246</p>
<p>FILM</p>
<p>    - Net sales			296    vs 394</p>
<p>    - Operating loss		  37    vs  18</p>
<p>NOTE - Philips Electronics NV has a majority stake in PolyGram.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
